WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.910
A town gets its first boba tea shop.

2
00:00:02.910 --> 00:00:04.810
There are lines out the door,

3
00:00:04.810 --> 00:00:06.400
every single day.

4
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.520
The owner earns far
more than she would need

5
00:00:08.520 --> 00:00:09.960
to stay in business.

6
00:00:09.960 --> 00:00:12.880
Economists call that economic profit.

7
00:00:12.880 --> 00:00:16.980
And nothing stops anyone else from
opening a shop just like hers.

8
00:00:16.980 --> 00:00:20.010
So when a product is very
profitable and anyone

9
00:00:20.010 --> 00:00:23.270
can start selling it,
where do the profits go?

10
00:00:23.270 --> 00:00:25.870
In this mission, you'll
follow a market from the short

11
00:00:25.870 --> 00:00:27.330
run to the long run,

12
00:00:27.330 --> 00:00:29.260
counting the firms as they go.

13
00:00:29.260 --> 00:00:31.510
Then you'll see why, in some industries,

14
00:00:31.510 --> 00:00:34.340
prices end up higher than they started.

15
00:00:34.340 --> 00:00:38.350
Your mission: find out how
long economic profit can last.
